/**
 * Cache policy for anonymous, public SEO pages (mod catalogue). Pure so it is unit-tested and usable from the
 * edge middleware. The rule is deliberately conservative: a response is only marked shareable when the request
 * carries no session (or impersonation) cookie and no Authorization header, so a logged-in or personalised page
